            "  Downloading pypdf-6.18.1-py3-none-any.whl.metadata (7.5 kB)\n",
            "Downloading pypdf-6.18.1-py3-none-any.whl (394 kB)\n",
            "Installing collected packages: pypdf\n",
            "Successfully installed pypdf-6.18.1\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Construction du système de recherche LlamaIndex\n",
        "\n",
        "Nous mettons en place l’architecture de recherche basée sur LlamaIndex :\n",
        "\n",
        "- **SimpleDirectoryReader** : lit automatiquement tous les documents présents dans le dossier fourni.\n",
        "- **LLMPredictor** : encapsule le modèle `gpt-3.5-turbo` pour l’utiliser comme moteur de génération et d’analyse au sein de LlamaIndex.\n",
        "- **GPTVectorStoreIndex** : transforme les documents en **vecteurs** (embeddings) et les stocke dans une base vectorielle optimisée pour la recherche sémantique.\n",
        "- **Moteur de requêtes** : à chaque requête, il renvoie les **3 documents les plus pertinents**, sur base de leur similarité vectorielle.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "COgbBCkH28Kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "documents = SimpleDirectoryReader(\n",
        "    input_files=[\"/content/drive/MyDrive/AGENTIC/Societe-Generale-Pilier-3_T2-2022_FR.pdf\"]\n",
        ").load_data()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Initialize LLM predictor\n",
        "llm_predictor = LLMPredictor(llm=ChatOpenAI(temperature=0, model_name=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"))\n",
        "\n",
        "# Service context\n",
        "service_context = ServiceContext.from_defaults(llm_predictor=llm_predictor)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Vector store index (top_k retrieval)\n",
        "index = GPTVectorStoreIndex.from_documents(documents, service_context=service_context)\n",
        "query_engine = index.as_query_engine(retriever_mode=\"default\", similarity_top_k=3)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "jxOrZO32ZlhL",
        "outputId": "f1c72430-6da1-488d-9de6-c50e8cff578a"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stderr",
          "text": [
            "/tmp/ipykernel_858/1541818955.py:6: LangChainDeprecationWarning: The class `ChatOpenAI` was deprecated in LangChain 0.0.10 and will be removed in 1.0. An updated version of the class exists in the :class:`~langchain-openai package and should be used instead. To use it run `pip install -U :class:`~langchain-openai` and import as `from :class:`~langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI``.\n",
            "  llm_predictor = LLMPredictor(llm=ChatOpenAI(temperature=0, model_name=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"))\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "LLMPredictor is deprecated, please use LLM instead.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Définition des outils à disposition de l’agent\n",
        "\n",
        "Nous définissons les différents outils que l’agent pourra utiliser :\n",
        "\n",
        "- **DocumentRetriever** : utilise LlamaIndex pour récupérer les documents les plus pertinents en fonction de la requête.\n",
        "- **Calculatrice** : gère les requêtes numériques (opérations, calculs, problèmes mathématiques).\n",
        "- **Wikipédia** : permet de récupérer des connaissances générales qui ne figurent pas dans les documents locaux.\n",
        "- **Outils** : chacun de ces outils est ensuite rendu **automatiquement accessible** par l’agent, qui peut les appeler dynamiquement selon les besoins de la requête.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "pvy9fvJy3PDo"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Document retrieval tool\n",
        "def retrieve_docs(query: str) -> str:\n",
        "    response = query_engine.query(query)\n",
        "    return str(response)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Simple calculator tool\n",
        "def calculator(query: str) -> str:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        return str(eval(query))\n",
        "    except:\n",
        "        return \"Cannot calculate that.\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# Wikipedia search tool\n",
        "def wiki_search(query: str) -> str:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        summary = wikipedia.summary(query, sentences=2)\n",
        "        return summary\n",
        "    except:\n",
        "        return \"No Wikipedia info found.\"\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "d5i9gCt8ZpV1"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "tools = [\n",
        "    Tool(name=\"DocumentRetriever\", func=retrieve_docs, description=\"Use this tool to answer questions using uploaded documents.\"),\n",
        "    Tool(name=\"Calculator\", func=calculator, description=\"Use this tool to solve math expressions.\"),\n",
        "    Tool(name=\"Wikipedia\", func=wiki_search, description=\"Use this tool to get Wikipedia summaries.\")\n",
        "]\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uy5mu7U9Zpy9"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Initialisation de la mémoire de l’agent\n",
        "\n",
        "Nous initialisons une **mémoire de conversation** pour permettre à l’agent de garder le contexte durant la session :\n",
        "\n",
        "- **ConversationBufferMemory** : conserve une trace des requêtes et des réponses précédentes, afin que l’agent puisse tenir compte de l’historique dans ses réponses.\n",
        "- **AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION** : configure un agent capable de décider **quel outil appeler** à partir de la description de la tâche, sans phase de pré-entraînement spécifique.\n",
        "- **verbose = True** : permet d’afficher les différentes étapes de raisonnement et les appels d’outils dans les logs, ce qui est utile pour le **débogage** et la compréhension du comportement de l’agent.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "XoMqhSZf3mya"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Conversation memory\n",
        "memory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n",
        "\n",
        "agent = initialize_agent(\n",
        "    tools=tools,\n",
        "    llm=ChatOpenAI(temperature=0, model_name=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"),\n",
        "    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n",
        "    memory=memory,\n",
        "    handle_parsing_errors=True,\n",
        "    verbose=True\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "Jo642HfwZro9",
        "outputId": "f71739a9-1747-4a44-f356-98fb3d9b9310"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stderr",
          "text": [
            "/tmp/ipykernel_858/2059506799.py:2: LangChainDeprecationWarning: Please see the migration guide at: https://python.langchain.com/docs/versions/migrating_memory/\n",
            "  memory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n",
            "/tmp/ipykernel_858/2059506799.py:4: LangChainDeprecationWarning: LangChain agents will continue to be supported, but it is recommended for new use cases to be built with LangGraph. LangGraph offers a more flexible and full-featured framework for building agents, including support for tool-calling, persistence of state, and human-in-the-loop workflows. For details, refer to the `LangGraph documentation <https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/>`_ as well as guides for `Migrating from AgentExecutor <https://python.langchain.com/docs/how_to/migrate_agent/>`_ and LangGraph's `Pre-built ReAct agent <https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/how-tos/create-react-agent/>`_.\n",
            "  agent = initialize_agent(\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Interaction avec l’agent\n",
        "\n",
        "- Les utilisateurs peuvent **interagir directement avec l’agent** en lui posant des questions ou en soumettant des requêtes.\n",
        "- L’agent **choisit automatiquement l’outil le plus adapté**, récupère les informations pertinentes, puis **génère une réponse structurée**.\n",
        "- Le système prend en charge :\n",
        "  - les **requêtes documentaires** (via LlamaIndex / DocumentRetriever),\n",
        "  - les **calculs mathématiques** (via l’outil Calculatrice),\n",
        "  - la **recherche de connaissances générales** (via Wikipédia).\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "arUe-59M4GS_"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "print(\"Agentic RAG activer, ecrire EXIT  pour arreter\")\n",
        "\n",
        "while True:\n",
        "    query = input(\"You: \")\n",
        "    if query.lower() in [\"exit\", \"quit\"]:\n",
        "        break\n",
        "    response = agent.run(query)\n",
        "    print(\"Agent:\", response)\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
